==English==
[[Image:BlurryDavid.jpg|thumb|right|A blurry photo.]]

===Etymology===
From {{suffix|en|blur|y}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈblɜːɹi/|lang=en}}
* {{rhymes|ɜːɹi|lang=en}}

===Adjective===
{{en-adj|er}}

# {{lb|en|of an image}} Not [[clear]], [[crisp]], or [[focus]]ed; having [[fuzzy]] edges.
#: ''If I take off my glasses, everything close up looks '''blurry'''.''
# {{lb|en|figuratively}} Not [[clear]]; lacking well-defined boundaries.
#: ''It would seem that the line between flirting and sexual harrassment has become quite '''blurry'''.''

====Derived terms====
* {{l|en|blurriness}}

